  "definition": "OBD Inspection",
  "effectiveDate": "2016-01-06",
  "historyNote": "#7731, eff 7-26-02 (See Revision Note #2 at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 3200) (formerly Saf-C 3223.03); ss by #9184, eff 6-20-08; ss by #11016, eff 1-6-16",
